>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Single-point calculation on the original coordinates and ligand-by-ligand Lewis review. The assignment applies to the input with H27 and net charge +1. Acetate retains two delocalized C–O bonds, Assign Cd(II). The optimized geometry and electronic calculations identify the N–N, C=N and N–O sites of the remaining neutral nitrogen ligand, N⁺–O⁻ serves as a charge-separated limiting form. Proton assignments for the same-ID H29 species remain unresolved. Localized 24 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

